{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"verifyLogoutToken","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"token","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"configuration","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OidcConfiguration","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/OidcConfiguration","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK17OidcConfigurationV"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"VerifiedLogoutToken","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/VerifiedLogoutToken","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK19VerifiedLogoutTokenV"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This is the half that carries security weight: the input arrives unsolicited, from the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"network, and instructs the RP to terminate a session. Every check below is required, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"each exists because skipping it has a name:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Signature against the OP’s JWKS, through the same §12.4 verifier — no second"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"key-fetching path."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"iss","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" matches the discovery issuer; ","type":"text"},{"code":"aud","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" contains this client’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"client_id","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". A token","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"minted for another RP is not accepted here.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"events","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" contains the back-channel logout key with an object value. This is what","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"distinguishes a logout token from an ID token; skipping it accepts a replayed ID token","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"as a logout instruction.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"nonce","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"absent","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":". Back-Channel Logout 1.0 §2.4 forbids it, and its presence is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the documented signature of an ID token being replayed — rejected, not ignored.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"At least one of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"sid"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"sub"},{"type":"text","text":" is present. A token naming neither identifies nothing."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"exp","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is in the future and "},{"code":"iat","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" recent."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"orderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/VerifiedLogoutToken\/sid"},{"type":"text","text":" is present, end that session only."}]},{"text":" Falling back to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"“every session for ","type":"text"},{"code":"sub","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"” when a ","type":"text"},{"code":"sid","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" was supplied is the same over-reach the server","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"refuses to make.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/VerifiedLogoutToken\/jwtID"},{"text":" is surfaced so the caller can deduplicate; this SDK does","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"not dedup internally (§12.7.3 rule 7) — delivery is at-least-once, and a library with no","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"durable store would silently drop a real second logout after a restart.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Instance Method","title":"verifyLogoutToken(_:configuration:)","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}],"symbolKind":"method","extendedModule":"AxiamSDK","externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK0A6ClientC17verifyLogoutToken_13configurationAA08VerifiedeF0VSS_AA17OidcConfigurationVtYaKF","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"verifyLogoutToken","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"configuration","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OidcConfiguration","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK17OidcConfigurationV"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"VerifiedLogoutToken","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK19VerifiedLogoutTokenV"}]},"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient"]]},"abstract":[{"text":"Verify a back-channel logout token the OP POSTed to this relying party’s own endpoint","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text"